        "The agent presents the person token it obtained in step 1 — the resource MUST have verified one before it issues a resource token.",
        "The mission arrives inside that token as mission_s256. There is no AAuth-Mission header in -11: the header and its IANA registration were both removed.",
        "The resource does not have the mission description or the tool list. Only the PS has those. It copies mission_s256 across verbatim without judging it.",
